Scope

- Covers the generated data files listed above.
- Does **not** cover the full reports on moneypeel.com, the MoneyPeel name or
  logo, or the generator that produced this repository.
- Revenue figures are published as **bands**. The underlying point values, the
  evidence behind them and the written teardowns are not part of this dataset.

Third-party marks

Category names come from a public product taxonomy; product names and logos
belong to their respective owners and appear here for identification only.
